---
import PolicySection from "./PolicySection.astro";
import { ul } from "./styles";
---

<PolicySection title="Why we use it and on what legal basis">
  <ul class:list={ul}>
    <li>
      To run your account and the group features (creating and joining a group, tasks, marking them done, streaks and
      the leaderboard) and to send the sign-up confirmation e-mail: performance of the contract, which is your use of
      StreakBoard (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR).
    </li>
    <li>
      To keep the service secure and to find and fix errors (request logs, error reports, session data and the security
      log): our legitimate interest in a working and secure service (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR).
    </li>
  </ul>
</PolicySection>
